# scripts/opcount: `kvbench bench put N` makes N puts into a std
# kv/memory store over 64 keys (ST3); the cost of one put is the slope
# between the two sizes. The control is hand Go with a map under a mutex;
# the floor is a bare map store.
unit put
sizes 200000 1200000
args bench put {n}
control benchmarks/kv/testdata/control
floor benchmarks/kv/testdata/floor
